  "_about": "The G80 M3 / M4 head-up display's look (Redline's Ramp, redline/hud-m.js) on the cluster, generated by tools/gen_g80map.py (edit that and regenerate). One g80 effect layer draws the cream rev rail climbing from the 0 at the bottom left and running flat over the top with a tab every 1000 rpm, the cream rev band and red needle under it, the red zone, the peak and the 8 slanted shift lights over it. While the map shows ('mapUp': Maps on cluster, CarPlay's Apple Maps / Waze / Google Maps) it shows through the middle of BMW's map window and fades out into the black before the gear and speed (left) and the readouts (right), without a rebuild (mapLive). Lettering: squared digits and Ubuntu, as Redline's HUD. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
